<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Teachers' Day</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5, #ffe4ec, #fff7f9);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            color: #4a2630;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 70px 20px 40px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 45px;
            color: #c2185b;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #75404d;
        }

        .heart {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -30px;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #e91e63;
            animation: floatUp linear infinite;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        @keyframes floatUp {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
                opacity: 0;
            }

            15% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

            100% {
                transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 70px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 30px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.15);
            border: 2px solid #ffd0df;
            transition: 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.25);
        }

        .card::before {
            content: "♥";
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 100px;
            color: rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.05);
            top: -25px;
            right: -10px;
        }

        .mini-heart {
            font-size: 45px;
            color: #e91e63;
            animation: heartbeat 1.2s infinite;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        @keyframes heartbeat {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }

            25% {
                transform: scale(1.15);
            }

            40% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }

            60% {
                transform: scale(1.12);
            }
        }

        .card h2 {
            color: #c2185b;
            font-size: 23px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .subject {
            color: #9c5365;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .message {
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #57353e;
        }

        .closing {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #c2185b;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px 50px;
            color: #8b5361;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .container {
                width: 92%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Happy Teachers' Day!</h1>
        <p>To all the teachers who guide, teach, and inspire us every day.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- Ma'am Linden -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Ma'am Linden</h2>
            <div class="subject">Values Education & Science</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Ma'am Linden, for teaching us both the importance
                of good values and the wonders of science. Thank you for
                helping us become better students and better people.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Ma'am!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ma'am Mai -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Ma'am Mai</h2>
            <div class="subject">Mathematics</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Ma'am Mai, for patiently teaching us mathematics
                and helping us understand problems that sometimes seem
                difficult. Your guidance helps us improve every day.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Ma'am!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ma'am Leni -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Ma'am Leni Sabulbero</h2>
            <div class="subject">Research</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Ma'am Leni, for guiding us through research,
                teaching us to think carefully, and helping us turn our
                ideas into meaningful work. We appreciate your patience
                and guidance.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Ma'am!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ma'am Maria Andi -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Ma'am Maria Andi</h2>
            <div class="subject">English</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Ma'am Maria Andi, for helping us improve our
                English, express our thoughts, and become more confident
                with our words. Thank you for sharing your knowledge with us.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Ma'am!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sir Roniel -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Sir Roniel Aspiras</h2>
            <div class="subject">MAPEH</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Sir Roniel, for making MAPEH a place where we can
                learn, create, move, and express ourselves. Thank you for
                your guidance and for helping us discover our abilities.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Sir!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sir Ron -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Sir Ron Tagactac</h2>
            <div class="subject">Creative Technology</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Sir Ron, for teaching us about technology and
                encouraging us to be creative. Your lessons help us learn
                skills that we can use both inside and outside the classroom.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Sir!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sir Sadicon -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Sir Sadicon</h2>
            <div class="subject">Araling Panlipunan</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Sir Sadicon, for teaching us about history,
                society, and our country. Thank you for helping us understand
                the world around us and appreciate where we came from.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Sir!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Ma'am Aubrey -->
        <div class="card">
            <div class="mini-heart">♥</div>
            <h2>Ma'am Aubrey</h2>
            <div class="subject">Filipino</div>

            <p class="message">
                Thank you, Ma'am Aubrey, for teaching us our language,
                literature, and culture. Thank you for helping us appreciate
                Filipino and express ourselves through our own language.
            </p>

            <p class="closing">Happy Teachers' Day, Ma'am!</p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        Made with appreciation and gratitude for our teachers.
        <br>
        Happy Teachers' Day!
    </footer>

    <script>
        function createHeart() {
            const heart = document.createElement("div");

            heart.classList.add("heart");
            heart.innerHTML = "♥";

            heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + "vw";
            heart.style.fontSize = (15 + Math.random() * 25) + "px";
            heart.style.animationDuration = (5 + Math.random() * 5) + "s";

            document.body.appendChild(heart);

            setTimeout(() => {
                heart.remove();
            }, 10000);
        }

        setInterval(createHeart, 500);
    </script>

</body>
</html>
